{"availability":"available","full":"ashvolt/artwork-preflight-agent","name":"artwork-preflight-agent","description":"Automated print-readiness checking for custom print orders: measures artwork against the ordered product on CPU in ~1s, clears clean files, explains the fix, escalates the rest. 78.7% auto-approved, 0 wrong clearances in 500. Demo video + live app.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-20T15:58:20Z","updated":"2026-10-06T15:50:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://artwork-preflight.streamlit.app/","topics":["ai-agents","ai-lab","anthropic-claude","computer-vision","document-automation","evaluation","fastapi","image-processing","mcp-server","model-context-protocol","opencv","portfolio","portfolio-featured","preflight","print-production","python","quality-control","streamlit"],"demo":"https://artwork-preflight.streamlit.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:29.161Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:29.161Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:29.161Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:29.161Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Automated print-readiness checking for custom print orders. Every uploaded file is measured against the product it was ordered on, in about a second, on CPU, with no model call — and comes back cleared for production, returned to the customer with an explanation, or escalated to a person with the findings attached.","▶ Watch the 13-minute product walkthrough — recorded against the running app: the three verdicts, cited measurements, the drafted customer reply, the marked-up artwork, and the same file re-checked as a large banner. Or try it live with your own artwork.","Unofficial project. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Sticker Mule. It uses no Sticker Mule data, systems or assets. Every dataset here is synthetic or built from openly licensed artwork. The company is named only to describe the class of operations problem this addresses. Volume and cost figures are labelled assumptions."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ashvolt/artwork-preflight-agent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2476741d1fb60993d92dcc69e3e1a4b7a5e909455ba9a28753caff6ca38ac381","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:29.291Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:29.291Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Automated print-readiness checking for custom print orders. Every uploaded file is measured against the product it was ordered on, in about a second, on CPU, with no model call — and comes back cleared for production, returned to the customer with an explanation, or escalated to a person with the findings attached.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ashvolt/artwork-preflight-agent/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"No API key is needed to run the checker. .env is only required for the optional model experiments and the AI-art generator; it is gitignored, and a leaked key must be rotated rather than rebased away.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ashvolt/artwork-preflight-agent/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The voice is synthesised locally with Kokoro-82M on CPU, so it needs no API key and no network.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ashvolt/artwork-preflight-agent/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2476741d1fb60993d92dcc69e3e1a4b7a5e909455ba9a28753caff6ca38ac381","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ashvolt/artwork-preflight-agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:29.292Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T15:50:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ashvolt/artwork-preflight-agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:29.292Z","hash":"2476741d1fb60993d92dcc69e3e1a4b7a5e909455ba9a28753caff6ca38ac381","originalBytes":12580,"storedBytes":12